{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>增美神維他命B雜丸120粒裝（Jamieson Vitamin B Complex 50）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧、莎莎、HKTVmall、Market Place及龍豐共6間零售商的網店報價。以同款單瓶標價計，最低與次低相差HK$70，約34%。</p>\n<h2>增美神維他命B雜丸120粒裝各網店報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單瓶標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單瓶總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜莎莎</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$138</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$138</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單瓶標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>龍豐</td>\n<td>HK$208</td>\n<td>HK$208</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HKTVmall</td>\n<td>HK$245</td>\n<td>HK$245</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Market Place</td>\n<td>HK$245</td>\n<td>HK$245</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$245</td>\n<td>HK$245</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$245</td>\n<td>HK$245</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>增美神維他命B雜丸120粒裝單瓶價錢點計？</h2>\n<p>買一瓶增美神維他命B雜丸120粒裝，莎莎的同款網上標價為HK$138，較表列次低標價HK$208少HK$70。增美神維他命B雜丸120粒裝這個價差以單瓶商品標價比較。若打算買多件，宜另計商戶的購買條件及結帳價。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月14日商戶網上報價，未計運費，價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源：<a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/%E5%A2%9E%E7%BE%8E%E7%A5%9E-%E5%A2%9E%E7%BE%8E%E7%A5%9E-%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BDb%E9%9B%9C%E4%B8%B8120%E7%B2%92/p/BP_241575\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/jamieson-vitamin-b-complex-50-120pcs/p/999136\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.sasa.com.hk/SalePage/Index/328858\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">莎莎</a><a href=\"https://www.hktvmall.com/hktv/zh/main/Jamieson-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%97%97%E8%89%A6%E5%BA%97/s/H6754005/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E7%94%A2%E5%93%81/%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BD/%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BDB%E9%9B%9C%E4%B8%B8-120%E7%B2%92/p/H6754005_S_H3281209184\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HKTVmall</a><a href=\"https://www.marketplacehk.com/zh-hant/wellcome/p/%E5%A2%9E%E7%BE%8E%E7%A5%9E-%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BDB%E9%9B%9C%E4%B8%B8120S/i/116572526.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Market Place</a><a href=\"https://eshop.lungfung.hk/product/mdn190331/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">龍豐</a></p>\n<p>這款B雜配方含維他命B1。維他命B1有助身體將食物轉化為能量，亦參與維持細胞正常運作。如對成分或服用有疑問，建議先諮詢醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。<a href=\"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/Thiamin-Consumer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIH ODS：維他命B1</a></p>\n<p>計算方法：（較高標價－較低標價）÷較高標價×100%。本次以（HK$208－HK$138）÷HK$208×100%計，約34%。上述比例未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463484471375062_8020176826af7f45d48d8f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"增美神維他命B雜丸120粒裝格價：莎莎 HK$138，單瓶約平34%\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463484471375062_8020176826af7f45d48d8f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>點樣先可以用圖中價格買到增美神維他命B雜丸120粒裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>以2026年11月14日網上報價，莎莎的單瓶商品總額為HK$138。條件為單瓶標價，未計運費。</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>這次只比較B Complex 50每瓶120粒的網店報價。不同批次或地區版本以收到的標籤及商戶說明為準。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T06:00:30.441111+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":874,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T05:40:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:35:10.350699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T05:53:56.416129+00:00","content_hash":"3c19c16e1dbfdbc1d80ee84ca2cc8bb3af685d27fb67e3c12c94db75ec981111","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}